# The published datasets and reports are recorded by sha256 (index.json, research_manifest.yaml),
# and the hash is of the LF bytes the publish commands write. Git must hand those bytes back on every
# platform: with core.autocrlf, the Windows default, a checkout otherwise rewrites each file with
# CRLF and `npm run verify:*` reports a sound dataset as a hash mismatch for every file.
the-archipelago/exports/** text eol=lf
the-archipelago/reports/** text eol=lf
